    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Barkeep of The Lucky Liar.</strong> Raven-haired. Quiet and circumspect as she serves drinks. Files away secrets she overhears.</p>\n<p><strong>Secret:</strong> Thayan agent working for Szass Tam. Planted in Icewind Dale years ago to watch for enemies of Szass Tam seeking refuge in Ten-Towns. Those she has marked as enemies have quietly vanished. No one in Ten-Towns knows her secret.</p>\n<p><strong>DM:</strong> She won't break cover for anything short of a direct, imminent threat. She has sent multiple coded messages to Thay. She is watching the party if they've done anything notable.</p>"
      },
